import{_ as t,o as i,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 910 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 9 — The 20% Activation Strategy","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 910 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 9 — The 20% Activation Strategy","no":910,"module":5,"tags":["Charter","Article 9","20% Activation","Strong-One Group","Power Foundation"],"related":["23-20% Activation Strategy Planning","17-Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards","75-20% Activation Strategy Implementation"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0910_模块5-第九条-20％激活战略.md","filePath":"en/0910_模块5-第九条-20％激活战略.md"}'),o={name:"en/0910_模块5-第九条-20％激活战略.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,h,u){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-910-myriad-rank-republican-civilizational-charter-·-article-9-—-the-20-activation-strategy" tabindex="-1">Entry 910 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 9 — The 20% Activation Strategy <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-910-myriad-rank-republican-civilizational-charter-·-article-9-—-the-20-activation-strategy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 910 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 9 — The 20% Activation Strategy&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 23, 17, 75</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-why-activate-the-top-20-of-strong-ones-first" tabindex="-1">Introduction: why activate the top 20% of strong ones first <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-why-activate-the-top-20-of-strong-ones-first" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: why activate the top 20% of strong ones first&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Civilizational ascension needs a power foundation, and that foundation cannot rest on one or two saviors. Article 9 writes the 20% activation strategy into the charter: within the first era after civilization&#39;s founding, activate 20% of all beings to the plane-sovereign strong-one level. This is not elitism; on the contrary — it is precisely to prevent strong-one monopoly. If the whole civilization has only one savior, he is both savior and the sole dictatorship hidden danger; only when 20% of all beings become qualified strong ones does civilization&#39;s power base become wide enough, so it does not collapse because of any one person&#39;s fall.</p><p>This article is from beginning to end placed under the six top-level axioms — the anti-predation axiom draws the bottom line, the republican axiom of Myriad Races establishes the subject, the collective-ascension axiom sets the direction, the causal self-discipline axiom guards the boundary, the law-first axiom preserves self-consistency; the five together constitute this article&#39;s insurmountable spiritual boundary.</p><p>Together with the previous five axioms, this article is also bound by Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity; predation thus fundamentally loses meaning.</p><h2 id="i-jurisprudential-basis" tabindex="-1">I. Jurisprudential Basis <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-jurisprudential-basis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Jurisprudential Basis&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article is based on the 20% Activation Strategy Planning (Document 23), the Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards (Document 17), and the 20% Activation Strategy Implementation (Document 75). Its internal logic is the collective-ascension axiom: the cosmos&#39;s overall ascension cannot rely only on a few sovereign strong ones, but requires universal evolution of all Myriad-Rank beings; the Alaya Network&#39;s effectiveness is positively correlated with the number and quality of connected life. Activating 20% of strong ones is precisely raising the network&#39;s core-node density above the safety threshold.</p><h2 id="ii-normative-content-three-step-activation-pace" tabindex="-1">II. Normative Content: Three-Step Activation Pace <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-normative-content-three-step-activation-pace" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Normative Content: Three-Step Activation Pace&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Article 9 quantifies the activation strategy into three steps:</p><ol><li>Short-term (within 100 years of civilization&#39;s founding): activate 1% of all beings to Origin Realm, establishing the first batch of guardian skeletons;</li><li>Mid-term (within 500 years): activate 10%, forming a strong-one network, preventing individual strong-one power monopoly;</li><li>Long-term (within 1000 years): activate 20%, providing a sufficient power foundation for the cosmos&#39;s overall ascension.</li></ol><p>The strategy relies on five pillars: the 300 systems&#39; opening, Multiplication-Fruit technology popularization, contract-responsibility mechanism, every-road-available guarantee, and mentor network.</p><h2 id="iii-scope" tabindex="-1">III. Scope <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-scope" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Scope&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article&#39;s &quot;20%&quot; covers all Myriad Ranks, especially emphasizing each clan must have its own sovereign strong-one representative, rather than human race monopolizing strong-one quotas. Low-endowment individuals and impoverished clans are equally within activation targets — activation is not picking geniuses and eliminating the weak, but using systems to hold up as many as possible. This article sets no clan-quota ceiling, only a floor of &quot;no clan may be absent.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Deliberately suppressing activation rate, concentrating strong-one quotas on some clan or surname, obstructing others&#39; breakthrough to preserve monopoly, depriving the weak of activation opportunities on grounds of &quot;insufficient talent,&quot; all constitute unconstitutionality under this article. Consequences: the relevant institution is ordered to rectify within a time limit, and activation rate is included in its accountability indicators; those artificially creating &quot;the one destined&quot; and creating protagonist-uniqueness dependence are pursued heavily under class solidification (entry 930) and anti-predation.</p><h2 id="v-supervision-mechanism" tabindex="-1">V. Supervision Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervision-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervision Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article is executed by the activation-rate ledger within Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision: each clan&#39;s and group&#39;s proportion reaching Origin Realm is real-time statistically tracked, and the gap to short/mid/long-term targets is publicized network-wide; the Anchor Supervisory Committee monitors strong-one quotas&#39; clan distribution, and if some clan&#39;s strong ones are long absent, targeted support is given. Eras with substandard activation rates are held accountable by the Myriad-Rank-republican council against the relevant executing institution.</p><h2 id="vi-seeing-the-strategy-through-a-forest" tabindex="-1">VI. Seeing the Strategy Through a Forest <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-seeing-the-strategy-through-a-forest" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Seeing the Strategy Through a Forest&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The 20% activation strategy&#39;s meaning is best analogized with a forest. If the whole forest has only one tallest big tree, one storm may destroy all; if 20% of trees all grow to a considerable height, the forest has a self-repair skeleton. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization spending a thousand years pushing 20% of beings to plane-sovereign levels is not to create a 20% privileged class, but to prepare for cosmic ascension a strong-one forest that will not be uprooted by one disaster. When each clan has its own representative tree in this forest, no one may threaten the whole forest with a single lone tree — this is precisely the activation strategy&#39;s anti-monopoly deep meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: Multiplication-Fruit technologization and mentor network maximize strong-one cultivation efficiency, avoiding inefficient groping</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: widely distributing strong ones is precisely to put an end to a single predator monopolizing the network by force</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type systems produce one protagonist after eons; Heng Yuan Zhou activates 20% of beings to sovereign levels in a thousand years, strong ones emerge in succession</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: activation rate is statistically tracked across Myriad Ranks; no clan may be absent</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the wider the strong-one base, the more civilization dares to expand toward the hyper-multiverse</p></li><li><p><strong>Universal equal infinity</strong>: every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing layabouts retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose higher-level infinity; predation thus fundamentally loses meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The 20% activation strategy is the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s institutional answer to the &quot;savior narrative.&quot; It does not bet on one person, it bets on Myriad Ranks; it does not rely on one ceiling, it relies on a forest. When 20% of all beings become guardians, cosmic ascension is truly irreversible.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/23-20％激活战略规划.html">Entry 23 · 20% Activation Strategy Planning</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/75-20％激活战略实施.html">Entry 75 · 20% Activation Strategy Implementation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/911_模块5-第十条-位面至高强者四维考核.html">Entry 911 · Article 10 Four-Dimensional Assessment of Plane-Sovereign Strong Ones</a></li></ul>',26)])])}const p=t(o,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
